cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Autoboat Telemetry Server"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
abstract: >-
  A lightweight Flask-based web server to collect, display, and manage
  telemetry data from the Virginia Tech Autoboat project. Collects boat
  status, autopilot parameters, and waypoints from autonomous boats, and
  serves them to the Autoboat website and telemetry nodes.
authors:
  - name: "Virginia Tech Autoboat Team"
    website: "https://autoboat.aoe.vt.edu"
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
date-released: "2026-08-18"
repository-code: "https://github.com/autoboat-vt/telemetry_server"
homepage: "https://autoboat.aoe.vt.edu"
documentation: "https://autoboat-vt.github.io/documentation"
keywords:
  - autoboat
  - telemetry
  - flask
  - virginia-tech
  - autonomous-boats
